            <title>0.51</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 16:03:57 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>202609221601</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.51</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>One person, one body, whichever source can see them</li>
<li>A peer is a body, placed by the station like every other</li>
<li>The reports go on the clipboard, from the station that is running</li>
<li>--dump-bodies: where every body is, and which gate put it there</li>
<li>A loaded rocket keeps its doors open, and says what it carries</li>
<li>A release ships what it carries, wherever the floor had got it to</li>
<li>--dump-ledger: what the station thinks is where, and why</li>
<li>A station is stopped before it is thrown away</li>
<li>The list is buttons, so a second click is a second play</li>
<li>A play looks once the body is where the play is about</li>
<li>The playbook aims once, on a floor built right the first time</li>
<li>Twenty-nine plays, the smallest floor each needs, and a sky you can turn off</li>
<li>A playbook: the list on the left, the station doing it on the right</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
